            <h3 style={{fontSize:"22px",marginBottom:" 12px"}}><b>7.2 Accessing, Updating and Correcting, Porting and Deleting Your Personal Data</b></h3>
            <p style={{marginBottom:" 12px"}}>You can access and update your personal data that MicroDegree collects and maintains as follows:</p>
